To modify the first clause re. padding values for  index 1, you could add any number at the beginning of the difftime vector in the data statement, but for phi_k, you would want to specify something in the model code like phi_k[1] <- 1 or 0.5, or whatever.
My memory is that BUGS/JAGS will throw an error if the indexing for a node begins at any value other than 1.

